### 1. Login as an ADMIN
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "admin"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.data.token.accessToken);
%}


### 2. Validate a gallery account (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/validate-gallery-account?galleryId={{galleryID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}



### 3. Validate the SAME gallery again (403 Forbidden gallery is already validated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/validate-gallery-account?galleryId={{galleryID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}


### 4. Validate a NON-GALLERY / unknown account (403 Forbidden  invalid account type)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/validate-gallery-account?galleryId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}



### 5. Login as a (non-admin) COLLECTOR account
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "collector@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "collector"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("collectorAccessToken", response.body.data.token.accessToken);
%}


### 6. Validate a gallery as a NON-ADMIN (403 Forbidden — AdminRoleGuard)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/validate-gallery-account?galleryId={{galleryID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{collectorAccessToken}}

